Package: dracut-sshd
Architecture: all
Depends: dracut, dracut-network, network-manager, netplan.io, wpasupplicant,
         openssh-server, net-tools, iputils-ping, curl, nano, cryptsetup-initramfs
Description: Provide SSH access to initramfs early user space
 This Dracut module integrates the OpenSSH sshd into your
 initramfs. It allows for remote unlocking of a fully encrypted
 root filesystem and remote access to the Dracut emergency shell (i.e. early userspace).
 This package also includes additional modules required for remote network access
 and sending telegram messages using bot. The following modules are included:
 * unlock-root - unlocks root user inside initrd
 * telegram-send - sends telegram message when system is online
 * network-manager-wireless - adds support for wireless networks
 * netplan - adds support for default Ubuntu network config
